(24585, 'scope', 1, '/skəʊp/', 'an area in which something acts or operates or has power or control: \"the range of a supersonic jet\"', '\"a piano has a greater range than the human voice\"; \"the ambit of municipal legislation\"; \"Within the compass of this article\"; \"within the scope of an investigation\"; \"outside the reach of the law\"; \"in the political orbit of a world power\"'),
