(44518, 'add', 2, '/æd/', 'make an addition (to); join or combine or unite with others; increase the quality, quantity, size or scope of', '\"We added two students to that dorm room\"; \"She added a personal note to her letter\"; \"Add insult to injury\"; \"Add some extra plates to the dinner table\"'),
