(51487, 'outstanding', 3, '/aʊtˈstæn.dɪŋ/', 'having a quality that thrusts itself into attention', '\"an outstanding fact of our time is that nations poisoned by anti semitism proved less fortunate in regard to their own freedom\"; \"a new theory is the most prominent feature of the book\"; \"salient traits\"; \"a spectacular rise in prices\"; \"a striking thing about Picadilly Circus is the statue of Eros in the center\"; \"a striking resemblance between parent and child\"'),
