(51496, 'distinguishable', 3, '/dɪˈstɪŋ.ɡwɪ.ʃə.bəl/', 'capable of being perceived as different or distinct', '\"only the shine of their metal was distinguishable in the gloom\"; \"a project distinguishable into four stages of progress\"; \"distinguishable differences between the twins\"'),
