(52485, 'earlier', 4, '/ˈɜː.li.ər/', 'earlier in time; previously', '\"I had known her before\"; \"as I said before\"; \"he called me the day before but your call had come even earlier\"; \"her parents had died four years earlier\"; \"I mentioned that problem earlier\"'),
